WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Many times, you have help from a good many sources.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.080
You may start the recruitment and the head coach will finish it up.

3
00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:17.840
For instance, Baton Rouge was in my recruiting . . . or at least most . . . part of Baton Rouge was.

4
00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:24.040
And so, I guess because of my friendship with Big Fuzzy Brown at Istrouma [High School],

5
00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:31.460
I had a small part, very small part in the recruitment of Billy Cannon.

6
00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:40.060
Johnny Robinson was at University High and I had a part in his recruitment.

7
00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:47.160
Did you have any surprises, walk-ons that turned out to be great that maybe weren’t recruited?

8
00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:55.080
Yes, although I didn’t have anything to do with it, Mickey Mangham came to us as a walk-on and nobody knew anything about him.

9
00:00:55.080 --> 00:01:04.120
And it didn’t take him long to earn himself a scholarship and he turned out to be very,

10
00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:10.440
very fine football player and has turned out to be a very fine man.
